    "text": "Google Adds Agentic AI Capabilities to Timesketch Cybersecurity Platform\nBy PYMNTS,\n6 hours ago“Powered by Sec-Gemini, Timesketch will accelerate incident response by using AI to automatically perform the initial forensic investigation,” Kent Walker, president of global affairs at Google and Alphabet, wrote in a Tuesday (July 15) blog post. “This lets analysts focus their efforts on other tasks, while drastically cutting down on investigation time.”",
